      "process": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Application Process:"
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 1:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " The applicant may visit and apply online at I-Khedut Portal: "
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/"
                    }
                  ],
                  "link": "https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/",
                  "type": "link"
                },
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 2:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " On the home page, click on ‘Schemes’ and then click on ‘Agricultural Schemes’."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 3:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Now select the scheme, click on the ‘Apply’ button and an application page will open."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 4:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Click on \"Apply New\" button and submit a new application."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 5:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Click on the \"Update Application\" button to add corrections to the application."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 6: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Once the application is done, confirm it."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 7:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Take a print out of the confirmed application."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 8:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Applicant can also check their Application Status/View/Print/Upload Application details from the below link: "
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/public/frm_Applicant_Corner.aspx"
                    }
                  ],
                  "link": "https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/public/frm_Applicant_Corner.aspx",
                  "type": "link"
                },
                {
                  "text": " "
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Post- Application Process:"
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 1:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " After applying, they must print the application, sign or provide a thumb impression, and keep a copy."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 2:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Approval for construction is granted based on the application."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 3:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " The farmer must construct the storage structure as per government rules within the specified timeframe."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 4:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " After construction, the signed application and assistance case paper must be submitted to the concerned office for financial support."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Contact Us:"
                },
                {
                  "text": " "
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Click here"
                    }
                  ],
                  "link": "https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/Public/frm_Public_Contacts.aspx",
                  "type": "link"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            }
          ],
          "type": "align_justify"
        }
      ],
      "process_md": "&gt; **Application Process:**\n\n**Step 1:** The applicant may visit and apply online at I-Khedut Portal: [https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/](https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/)\n**Step 2:** On the home page, click on ‘Schemes’ and then click on ‘Agricultural Schemes’.\n**Step 3:** Now select the scheme, click on the ‘Apply’ button and an application page will open.\n**Step 4:** Click on &amp;quot;Apply New&amp;quot; button and submit a new application.\n**Step 5:** Click on the &amp;quot;Update Application&amp;quot; button to add corrections to the application.\n**Step 6:** Once the application is done, confirm it.\n**Step 7:** Take a print out of the confirmed application.\n**Step 8:** Applicant can also check their Application Status/View/Print/Upload Application details from the below link: [https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/public/frm_Applicant_Corner.aspx](https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/public/frm_Applicant_Corner.aspx) \n&gt; **Post- Application Process:**\n\n**Step 1:** After applying, they must print the application, sign or provide a thumb impression, and keep a copy.\n**Step 2:** Approval for construction is granted based on the application.\n**Step 3:** The farmer must construct the storage structure as per government rules within the specified timeframe.\n**Step 4:** After construction, the signed application and assistance case paper must be submitted to the concerned office for financial support.\n&gt; **Contact Us:** [Click here](https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/Public/frm_Public_Contacts.aspx).\n\n"
    }
  ],
